id: F07
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feBytesCanonical: comparison flip, 'v < p: return true' -> 'v <= p: return true', which would accept one non-canonical encoding (a byte string equal to p in its most-significant differing position) as canonical.
====OLD====
    if v < p: return true
====NEW====
    if v <= p: return true
====END====
